cff-version: 1.2.0
title: DotAmi
message: >-
  If you cite something you found here, cite the entry's own source first — the statute, the
  regulation or the authority's page. DotAmi is the map, not the authority.
type: software
authors:
  - name: The DotAmi contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/Dot-Ami/dotami
abstract: >-
  An open-source map of paths to financial freedom — structures, write-offs, grants,
  thresholds, elections and strategies — with every claim cited to the law that makes it work
  and dated with the day a human last read the source. Canada is the first jurisdiction mapped.
keywords:
  - tax
  - small-business
  - canada
  - citations
  - open-data
license: Apache-2.0
license-url: https://github.com/Dot-Ami/dotami/blob/main/LICENSE
